  {type: "dialogue", side: "character", speaker: "Higher Power", label: "???", text: "\"Don't worry, the seeped scent of cigarette smoke will wear off.\""},
  {type: "action", text: "You hear a light chuckle and rough throat clear."},
  {type: "dialogue", side: "character", speaker: "Higher Power", label: "???", text: "They say it is described to be a circle of sadness. I'd say it is quite the opposite. It's the birth of hope. I can't lie, my first time here I thought it was an outtake of Fight Club. I kinda stumbled across this place on my way to a church. Was meant to assist a grieving widow. I take care of these people. Somewhat..."},
  {type: "dialogue", side: "character", speaker: "Higher Power", label: "Mabel", text: "My name is Mabel, a Guardian of this meeting. Now I have help!", setVar: "bossName", setValue: "Mabel"},
  {type: "dialogue", side: "character", speaker: "Higher Power", label: "Mabel", text: "I'm assuming you're new?"},
  {type: "dialogue", side: "character", speaker: "Higher Power", label: "Mabel", text: "What can I call you?"},
  {type: "namePrompt"},
  {type: "typedChoice", options: [
