    {text: "Yeah, first time. What's my job here?"},
    {text: "I don't really understand what's happening."}
  ]},
  {type: "dialogue", side: "character", speaker: "Higher Power", label: "Mabel", text: "Well, you pick one to assist each week. We hear members share and then we guide. We can nudge, suggest, plant the seed so to speak, and can't force one to be sober but rather help them see what they can do to be better, achieve greater things and maybe see a better tomorrow..."},
  {type: "dialogue", side: "player", speaker: "You", text: "So I can pick any person? I'm a god now??"},
  {type: "dialogue", side: "character", speaker: "Higher Power", label: "Mabel", text: "Mhmm, not exactly. You're a higher power, a guardian angel for the Mirabel meeting. We assist and provide the tools. We cannot force one to be better. Take a look at who is here tonight...Maybe someone will be of interest. I need help with this meeting, it seems to be a popular one.", setVar: "assignedMeeting", setValue: "Mirabel Meeting"},
  {type: "choice", side: "character", speaker: "Higher Power", label: "Mabel", text: "Let's see who's here tonight.", dest: "P_00_Member_Selection"}
