:: B1C1_AAMessage_01P2 {"position":"1325,700","size":"100,100"}
<div class="menu-screen">
<div class="quote-box">
<div id="dialogueLine">
<p>"Yes, there is a long period of reconstruction ahead. We must take the lead. A remorseful mumbling that we are sorry won't fit the bill. We ought to sit down with the family and frankly analyse the past as we now see it, being very careful not to criticise them. Their defects may be glaring, but the chances are that our own actions are partly responsible. So we clean house with the family, ask each morning in our meditation that our Higher Power show us the way of patience, tolerance, kindliness and love."</p>
<p class="chat-citation">Chapter 6 "Into Action," p. 83, Big Book of Alcoholics Anonymous</p>
</div>
<div id="dialoguePrompt" class="quote-prompt">
<<link "▼">>\
<<run addQuote("Yes, there is a long period of reconstruction ahead...", "Chapter 6 \"Into Action,\" p. 83, Big Book of Alcoholics Anonymous")>>\
<<replace "#dialoguePrompt">>\
<div class="continue-link"><<link "continue" "B1C4_Meeting_SerenityPrayer">><</link>></div>\
<</replace>>\
<</link>>
</div>
</div>
</div>

:: B1C2_01_Opening {"position":"375,425","size":"100,100"}
<<set $currentDate to "Tue, 23 April 2024">>
<<set $currentTime to "7:00pm">>
<<run $('body').addClass('scene-night')>>
<<run updateAngelStatus()>>
<<set $sceneBeats to [
  {type: "text", side: "them", text: "Hey, you free tonight? 😉", time: "7:00pm", sound: "audio/notif.mp3"},
  {type: "text", side: "me", text: "Maybe... what's in it for me?", time: "7:15pm", sound: "audio/send_notif.mp3"},
  {type: "text", side: "them", text: "You spending the night with me... taking care of you", time: "7:42pm", sound: "audio/notif.mp3"},
  {type: "text", side: "me", text: "And what makes you think i want that ;)", time: "7:43pm", sound: "audio/send_notif.mp3"},
  {type: "text", side: "them", text: "From the way you were moaning for me", time: "7:44pm", sound: "audio/notif.mp3"},
  {type: "thought", text: "My heart beats throughout my body. I haven't seen him in a while."},
  {type: "freeType", side: "character", speaker: "Higher Power", text: "You do some background research on this guy. He does not seem like a nice guy in any way."},
  {type: "freeType", side: "character", speaker: "Higher Power", text: "Didn't he ghost you like twice? I don't think you should see him..."},
  {type: "dialogue", side: "player", speaker: "Anesu", text: "Well he said he was going through something, I mean I guess it's fair?"},
  {type: "freeType", side: "character", speaker: "Higher Power", text: "You don't seem too sure about that, Anesu. Just stay home, hang out with Micah or something."},
  {type: "dialogue", side: "player", speaker: "Anesu", text: "Micah? He wants nothing to do with me. He's still mad at me."},
  {type: "freeType", side: "character", speaker: "Higher Power", text: "So spending it with this asshole is better? At least you know Micah loves you."},
  {type: "text", side: "them", text: "Come over tonight babe", time: "7:52pm", sound: "audio/notif.mp3"},
  {type: "text", side: "me", text: "I don't have my car tonight :((", time: "7:53pm", sound: "audio/send_notif.mp3"},
  {type: "text", side: "me", text: "Come and get me?", time: "9:53pm", sound: "audio/send_notif.mp3"},
  {type: "freeType", side: "character", speaker: "Higher Power", text: "You HAVE no car, NO LICENSE might I add? And what exactly are you gonna tell Mama?"},
  {type: "expandable", side: "player", speaker: "Anesu", shortText: "Telling her nothing, no guy is ever allowed in my life.", layers: [
    "I can't say anything. She won't even be able to begin to understand",
    "If I tell her, she'll say I told you so, and I can't hear that right now — not when I already know she's right."
  ], partialImpacts: {anesuGuard: -0.3}, nudgeImpacts: {anesuGuard: -0.5}, skipImpacts: {anesuGuard: 0.5}},
  {type: "freeType", side: "character", speaker: "Higher Power", text: "And with good reason! They've all been dicks and only want you for sex."},
  {type: "expandable", side: "player", speaker: "Anesu", shortText: "Well I want them for just sex too...", layers: [
    "Sex can feel good...?? Maybe I just being lame.",
    "I don't, actually. I just want someone to look at me like I matter, and sex is the only version of that I know how to ask for."
  ], partialImpacts: {familyAwareness: 0.3}, nudgeImpacts: {familyAwareness: 0.5}, skipImpacts: {anesuGuard: 0.5}},
  {type: "freeType", side: "character", speaker: "Higher Power", text: "Then why do you get so upset when they disappear?"},
  {type: "breathe", text: "The silence grows despicably loud.", duration: 2500},
  {type: "thought", text: "It is always an awful chase of cat and mouse. It's the same result over and over. Insanity manifested. It says it right on the walls at Mirabel — repeating the same behaviours, expecting the same result."},
  {type: "text", side: "them", text: "What time?", time: "8:02pm", sound: "audio/notif.mp3"},
  {type: "text", side: "me", text: "10pm??", time: "8:03pm", sound: "audio/send_notif.mp3"},
  {type: "text", side: "them", text: "I'll see you then gorgeous", time: "8:04pm", sound: "audio/notif.mp3"},
  {type: "expandable", side: "player", speaker: "Anesu", shortText: "See? He thinks I'm gorgeous.", layers: [
    "He thinks I'm gorgeous! That means he likes me!",
    "I just need someone to think that right now. I don't care that it's him. I just need it to be true from somebody."
  ], partialImpacts: {anesuGuard: -0.2}, nudgeImpacts: {anesuGuard: -0.5}, skipImpacts: {anesuGuard: 0.5}},
  {type: "freeType", side: "character", speaker: "Higher Power", text: "Correction, he thinks your tits are gorgeous."},
  {type: "dialogue", side: "character", speaker: "Higher Power", text: "And I thought you didn't like sex? I thought you came to that conclusion with Sheryl?"},
  {type: "expandable", side: "player", speaker: "Anesu", shortText: "I mean, I could like it with him?", layers: [
    "He could be kind about it...Maybe he's the one who can make it enjoyable?",
    "Maybe the first few times haven't been exactly how I wanted...m",
    "Ugh I know I won't. I know exactly how this goes. But I want to feel wanted, I NEED to feel wanted."
  ], partialImpacts: {anesuGuard: -0.3}, nudgeImpacts: {anesuGuard: -1, familyAwareness: 0.5}, skipImpacts: {anesuGuard: 1}},
  {type: "freeType", side: "character", speaker: "Higher Power", text: "Oh please, this tool? This fucking guy? You met him on some lame app, we seriously can't still be doing this."},
  {type: "dialogue", side: "character", speaker: "Higher Power", text: "Maybe this isn't the time for it. This is the opposite of putting yourself first."},
  {type: "freeType", side: "character", speaker: "Higher Power", text: "And all of a sudden being okay with having sex is a huge deal out of nowhere. Why the big jump with him? Why not wai—"},
  {type: "choice", side: "player", speaker: "Anesu", text: "I'm gonna see him tonight", dest: "B1C2_02_GoingToSeeElias", impacts: {anesuGuard: 1}},
  {type: "action", text: "or..."},
  {type: "choice", side: "player", speaker: "Anesu", text: "I'll stay home", dest: "B1C2_StayingHome" , impacts: {anesuGuard: -1}}
]>>
<<set $beatIndex to 0>>
